.claude/worktrees/

## Personal training data
# The Strong export is 1.4 MB of one person's health history and has no reason
# to be in version control. What the repo *does* own is the reviewed
# translation of it — scripts/data/strong_exercise_map.json — because that's
# the part that took judgment and that anything else importing the same format
# would need. See scripts/README.md.
notes/Workout App/workout_history/
